===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|GS}}====
National Park appeared in ''[[EP161|The Bug Stops Here]]'', where {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} came by it just in time to see the Bug-Catching Contest starting. Ash and {{an|Casey}}, who also appeared at the site, decided to participate in the contest. Casey ended up catching a {{p|Weedle}} that Ash was trying to catch, but eventually Ash caught himself a {{TP|Casey|Beedrill}}. Following a confrontation with {{TRT}}, during which [[Casey's Chikorita]] evolved into a {{p|Bayleef}}, Ash was declared the winner of the contest, earning him a [[Sun Stone]] and allowing him to keep the Pokémon he had caught. Before the group parted ways with Casey, Ash decided to give Beedrill to Casey, knowing her love of yellow-and-black-striped Pokémon.
